rec-002770.en:
But at Titan the enemy folded out with
enough precision to arrive right beside
the Macross;

rec-020250.en:
They were healthy males, after all;
perhaps taking an interest in an idol
singer was the natural response.

rec-02059c.en:
He went to his lover's room as always,
for the pineapple salad he was promised,
and fell there at her guitar.

